# Bhoonidhi credentials.
#
#   cp .env.example .env     then fill these in and:  make login
#
# Register free at https://bhoonidhi.nrsc.gov.in/ (Sign Up). Approval is
# usually immediate for an academic address. BHOONIDHI_USER is the user id you
# chose at registration, NOT your email address, unless they are the same.
#
# .env is gitignored. Never commit real credentials.
BHOONIDHI_USER=
BHOONIDHI_PASS=

# Optional. Override only if NRSC moves the API.
# BHOONIDHI_API=https://bhoonidhi-api.nrsc.gov.in
